                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye yes, sirikiirasi inabinokus, karaida ikaroakakus, karaida airujasiakus, karaida ikadwarakakus, karaida ikacudakakus, lukilimokinete ebe, ‘Mam ijaanakinete ekabaka loko Babulon.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai kidwarakinete yes nukainal, ayaŋaar yes naelwana kakwapukus; kasodi eoŋ aireŋear yes, ido iwoliorete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye ateker naibwaikini emurisinike ajookot naka ekabaka loko Babulon, kijaanak, ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Enyeini ŋin aiboi kakwapukee: ido ekoriete iboikinos nen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
