              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kalimok Sedekia ekabaka loka Yuda akiro nun kere kwape ajaatar, kabala ebe: “Kibwaikis imurisinakus aiookot naka ekabaka loko Babulon, kijaanakis ŋes ka iketuŋa, tetere iiarete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
