        {
          "text": " Kwabo sirikiirasi akiro nuka inabin luineras kayes ebe, ‘Mam ijaanakinete ekabaka loko Babulon.’ Naarai edwarete kesi nukainal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
