          "text": " Ido da alimokin isascdotin ka ituŋa lu kere ebe, “Inera EJAKAIT kwanata ebe: Sirikiirasi akiro nuka jnabinokus lukidwarakinete, ebalas ebe, ‘Koany, iboro lukorogo loka EJAKAIT eapiete bo bo ainyakunio koBabulon,’ naarai edwarete nukainal. ",
